%% Mermaid sequence diagram: Outbound call flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Mobile App (UI)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant CO as Call Orchestrator
    participant T as Telephony (Twilio)
    participant P as Prospect/Customer
    participant R as Realtime Orchestrator
    participant STT as STT Provider
    participant DM as Dialog Manager (LLM)
    participant TTS as ElevenLabs TTS
    participant DB as Storage (S3/DB)

    App->>API: POST /api/call/outbound {to, from, agentPersonaId}
    API->>CO: Validate + Idempotency-Key
    CO->>T: Create outbound call (dial to P)
    T-->>CO: externalCallId
    CO->>R: Initialize session (JWT/wsUrl, config)
    par Connect parties
        App-->>R: Subscribe WebSocket (wss://.../realtime)
        T->>P: Ringing
    end
    P-->>T: Answer
    T->>R: Media path up (SIP↔WebRTC)
    R->>DB: Start recording
    R->>STT: Stream audio
    STT-->>R: transcript.partial
    R-->>App: transcript.partial
    R->>DM: Context + partials
    DM-->>R: Reply text
    R->>TTS: Stream TTS
    TTS-->>R: tts.chunk (first bytes)
    R-->>T: Audio
    T-->>P: Audio
    loop Conversation
        STT-->>R: transcript.final
        R->>DB: Persist
        R->>DM: Update dialog
        DM-->>R: Next reply
        R->>TTS: Stream TTS
        TTS-->>R: tts.chunk...
        R-->>T: Audio...
        T-->>P: Audio...
    end
    CO->>DB: Update status, cost
    R-->>App: call.ended + links
